2. get trident with riptide and water
3. Start loading for riptide, but release the trident before you get launched. Move to some direction at the same time.
4. Get setbacked and simulation flagged

The reason seems to be that `MovementCheckRunner` doesn't check for early release at all for tridents:

```java
// line 371 in MovementCheckRunner
boolean clientClaimsRiptide = player.packetStateData.tryingToRiptide;
if (player.packetStateData.tryingToRiptide) {
    long currentTime = System.currentTimeMillis();
